							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td>Air lock</td>
							<td>Open air valve on gun.</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td class="bold" rowspan="2">Material runs out of bottom of sprayer</td>
							<td>Pump hose worn out</td>
							<td>Replace hose.</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td>Loose fittings</td>
							<td>Check and retighten all fittings.</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td class="bold" rowspan="6">No air from compressor</td>
							<td>Gun air valve closed</td>
							<td>Open gun air valve.</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td>Low voltage</td>
							<td>
								Check extension cord length and gauge. Replace if different
